OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer's neck cut as police
OL,4,Ainvolved in standoff
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has had their face and
OL,7,Fneck cut while attempting to detain a
OL,8,Fman in Peacehaven, the force says.
OL,10,FSussex Police said officers were called
OL,11,Fto an address in South Coast Road at
OL,12,Fabout 10:05 GMT on Friday after
OL,13,Freceiving a report of a man making
OL,14,Fthreats to kill.
OL,16,FA force spokesperson said the officer's
OL,17,Finjuries were not thought to be serious
OL,18,Fbut he was taken to hospital for
OL,19,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
